  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Note, the editor CSS styles were recently moved into CSS global variables a few versions back. This release: 1) Added a \"View HTML\" button to all the context menus in the rich text editor; 2) Added a feature to show the link address in the status bar when the user hovers over the link; 3) applied the recommended practice to formatting tables and improved editing.",
